    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">On cold, clear, moonlit night in late October, DCI Kelso Strang stepped outside the bothy on Suilven and heard, faint but unmistakable, the howl of a wolf. An unsettling sound - but it isn&apos;t the only unsettling thing about the remote township of Inverbeg in Sutherland, where he&apos;s taking a break with an old army friend.</marc:subfield>
